  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, that the dwellinghouse at &lt;a data-cke-saved-href=&quot;https://harrow-planning.idoxcloud.com/locations/index.html?fa=edit&amp;amp;id=1912355&quot; href=&quot;https://harrow-planning.idoxcloud.com/locations/index.html?fa=edit&amp;amp;id=1912355&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;113a Byron Road, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 7TB&lt;/a&gt;, has been in use as two self-contained residential units for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application. The existing development is therefore considered to be lawful.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 115%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nuse of the dwellinghouse &lt;font face=&quot;Aptos, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://harrow-planning.idoxcloud.com/locations/index.html?fa=edit&amp;amp;id=1912355&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;113a Byron Road, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 7TB&lt;/a&gt;, as two\r\nself-contained residential units, is immune from enforcement action and is therefore\r\nlawful under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
